<title>USA: U.S. blue chips soft at open, techs gain.</title>
<headline>U.S. blue chips soft at open, techs gain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. blue chips were mixed to slightly lower at the open on Wednesday, while technology stocks continued to gather steam.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials index was off 5.81 at 8181.73. The 30-year long bond off 2/32 at 6.50 percent yield.</p>
